{{!
    @template local_jedomi/admin/avatar_option

    Label of one option of the avatar selector of the Personalization tab: the avatar image, or the Jedomi icon, and
    its name.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * icon object - {"trigger": true} when the option is the Jedomi icon (no image)
    * url string - Address of the avatar image, when it is not the Jedomi icon
    * label string - Name of the option

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/local/jedomi/pix/avatars/avatar_01.png",
        "label": "Avatar 1"
    }
}}
<span class="local_jedomi-avatar-option">
    {{#icon}}
    <span class="local_jedomi-avatar-option-icon">{{> local_jedomi/local/sidebar/icon }}</span>
    {{/icon}}
    {{^icon}}
    <img class="local_jedomi-avatar-option-img" src="{{url}}" alt="" width="56" height="56">
    {{/icon}}
    <span class="local_jedomi-avatar-option-label">{{label}}</span>
</span>
